[
  {
    "content_id": "10008001001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 1:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08001001",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;在士师执政的时代，犹大发生了饥荒。有一个人带着妻子和两个儿子从犹大的伯利恒迁到摩押境内寄居。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008001002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 1:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08001002",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;这个人名叫以利米勒，妻子叫拿俄米，两个儿子分别叫玛伦和基连。他们都是犹大 伯利恒的以法他人。他们来到摩押，就在那里住了下来。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008001003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 1:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08001003",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;后来，拿俄米的丈夫以利米勒去世了，留下她和两个儿子。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008001004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 1:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08001004",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;这两个儿子都娶了摩押的女子为妻，一个名叫俄珥巴，一个名叫路得。在那里住了大约十年后，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008001005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 1:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08001005",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;玛伦和基连二人都去世了，只剩下拿俄米，没有了丈夫，也没有了儿子。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008001006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 1:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08001006",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;后来，拿俄米在摩押听说耶和华眷顾祂的子民，使他们五谷丰登，就带着两个儿媳妇准备回故乡。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008001007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 1:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08001007",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;她们离开所居住的地方，动身返回犹大。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008001008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 1:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08001008",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;拿俄米对两个儿媳妇说：“你们还是各回娘家去吧！愿耶和华恩待你们，就好像你们恩待死去的丈夫和我一样。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008001009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 1:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08001009",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;愿耶和华使你们都有机会再嫁，找到好归宿。”拿俄米说完了，就亲吻她们。她们都放声大哭，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008001010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 1:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08001010",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;说：“不！我们要跟你一起回你的家乡。”</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008001011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 1:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08001011",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;拿俄米说：“我的女儿啊，回娘家去吧！为什么要跟我去呢？难道我还能生儿子做你们的丈夫吗？</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008001012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 1:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08001012",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;回去吧！我的女儿啊，走吧！我已经老了，不可能再嫁人了。就算我还有指望，今晚能再结婚生子，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008001013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 1:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08001013",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;难道你们能一直不嫁，等到他们长大吗？不要这样，我的女儿啊！这样你们会很苦，我就更苦了，因为耶和华伸手惩罚我。”</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008001014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 1:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08001014",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;她们又放声大哭，俄珥巴就亲吻婆婆，向她道别，但路得却依依不舍，不肯离去。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008001015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 1:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08001015",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;拿俄米说：“你看，你嫂嫂已经回她家乡和她拜的神明那里去了，你也跟着嫂嫂回去吧！”</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008001016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 1:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08001016",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;路得说：“不要逼我撇你而去。你往哪里去，我也要往哪里去；你住在哪里，我也要住在哪里；你的同胞就是我的同胞，你的上帝就是我的上帝；</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008001017",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 1:17",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08001017",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>17</sup>&nbsp;你死在哪里，我也死在哪里、葬在哪里。只有死才能把我们分开。否则，愿耶和华重重地惩罚我！”</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008001018",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 1:18",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08001018",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>18</sup>&nbsp;拿俄米见路得坚决要跟她走，就不再劝阻她了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008001019",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 1:19",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08001019",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>19</sup>&nbsp;于是，二人便一同回到伯利恒。她们进了伯利恒，全城轰动。妇女们问：“这不是拿俄米吗？”</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008001020",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 1:20",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08001020",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>20</sup>&nbsp;拿俄米对她们说：“不要再叫我拿俄米了，叫我玛拉吧！因为全能者叫我过得好苦啊！</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008001021",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 1:21",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08001021",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>21</sup>&nbsp;我曾满满地离开这里，现在耶和华却使我空空地回来。既然耶和华叫我受苦，全能者使我遭难，为何还叫我拿俄米呢？”</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008001022",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 1:22",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08001022",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>22</sup>&nbsp;拿俄米带着她的儿媳妇摩押女子路得从摩押回到了伯利恒，那时正是开始收割大麦的季节。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008002001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 2:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08002001",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;拿俄米的丈夫以利米勒有个亲戚，名叫波阿斯，是个有名望的财主。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008002002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 2:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08002002",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;摩押女子路得对拿俄米说：“让我到田里去，跟在那些愿意恩待我的人后面，捡些麦穗回来。”拿俄米说：“去吧，我的女儿！”</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008002003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 2:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08002003",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;于是，路得便去了。她恰巧来到以利米勒的亲戚波阿斯的田里，跟在收割的人后面捡麦穗。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008002004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 2:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08002004",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;当时，波阿斯刚好从伯利恒来到田间，向那些收割的工人问安说：“愿耶和华与你们同在。”他们回答说：“愿耶和华赐福给你。”</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008002005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 2:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08002005",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;波阿斯问负责收割的工头说：“那是谁家的女子？”</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008002006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 2:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08002006",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;工头回答说：“她是摩押女子，跟拿俄米刚从摩押回来。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008002007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 2:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08002007",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;她求我让她跟在收割的人后面，捡工人扎捆时遗落的麦穗。她一大早就来到这里，一直捡到现在，除了在凉棚里稍微坐了一会儿之外，几乎没有休息。”</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008002008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 2:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08002008",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;波阿斯对路得说：“姑娘，听我说，你不用到别人的田里去拾麦穗了，也不必离开这里，只管留下来跟我的女工在一起。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008002009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 2:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08002009",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;你看我的工人在哪一块田里收割，就跟着我的女工去，我已经吩咐工人不可欺负你。要是你渴了，就去水罐那里喝工人打回来的水。”</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008002010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 2:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08002010",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;路得就俯伏在地叩谢他，说：“我不过是个外族人，你为什么这样恩待我、体恤我？”</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008002011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 2:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08002011",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;波阿斯说：“自从你丈夫过世之后，你怎样善待婆婆，怎样离开父母和家乡来到素不相识的人当中，我都听说了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008002012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 2:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08002012",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;愿耶和华照你所行的奖赏你！你来投靠在以色列的上帝耶和华的翅膀下，愿祂厚厚地赏赐你。”</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008002013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 2:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08002013",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;路得说：“我主啊！我真是在你面前蒙恩，虽然我连你的婢女都不如，你还好言安慰我。”</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008002014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 2:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08002014",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;吃饭的时候，波阿斯对路得说：“来，吃一点饼吧，可以蘸着醋吃。”路得便坐在那些收割工人旁边。波阿斯递给她一些烤好的麦穗。她吃饱了，还有剩余的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008002015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 2:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08002015",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;当她起来又要去捡麦穗的时候，波阿斯就吩咐他的工人说：“你们要任由她捡，就算她从麦捆中捡麦穗，你们也不要为难她。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008002016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 2:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08002016",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;甚至要从麦捆中抽一些出来让她捡，不要责骂她。”</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008002017",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 2:17",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08002017",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>17</sup>&nbsp;于是，路得便在田间继续捡麦穗，到了黄昏，她把捡到的麦穗打了，大约有十公斤大麦。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008002018",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 2:18",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08002018",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>18</sup>&nbsp;她把捡来的麦子带回城里给婆婆拿俄米看，又把剩下来的食物给婆婆。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008002019",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 2:19",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08002019",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>19</sup>&nbsp;婆婆问她：“你今天在哪里拾麦穗？在哪里做工？愿那善待你的人蒙福！”她就告诉婆婆说：“今天我在一个名叫波阿斯的人那里工作。”</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008002020",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 2:20",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08002020",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>20</sup>&nbsp;拿俄米说：“愿耶和华赐福给他，他对活着的和过世的都是那么有情有义。”拿俄米又对路得说：“这人是我们的近亲，有为我们赎业的责任。”</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008002021",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 2:21",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08002021",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>21</sup>&nbsp;摩押女子路得说：“他还对我说，‘你可以跟在我的工人后面捡麦穗，直到他们把我的庄稼都收完为止。’”</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008002022",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 2:22",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08002022",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>22</sup>&nbsp;拿俄米对儿媳路得说：“我的女儿啊，你就跟他的女工一起到田里去，免得去别人的田里被欺负。”</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008002023",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 2:23",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08002023",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>23</sup>&nbsp;因此，路得便常跟波阿斯的女工在一起捡麦穗，直到大麦小麦都收割完毕。路得就这样陪伴婆婆过日子。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008003001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 3:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08003001",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;一天，路得的婆婆拿俄米对她说：“我的女儿啊，我实在应该为你找个好归宿，使你生活幸福。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008003002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 3:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08003002",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;波阿斯不是我们的亲戚吗？而且你又常与他的女工在一起。今晚他会在麦场簸大麦。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008003003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 3:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08003003",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;你要梳洗打扮、抹上香膏、换件衣服，然后去麦场，但不要让他认出你是谁。等他吃饱喝足，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008003004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 3:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08003004",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;躺下睡觉的时候，你看准他躺卧的地方，去掀开盖在他脚上的被，躺在那里，到时他必定会告诉你该怎样做。”</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008003005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 3:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08003005",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;路得说：“好，我一定照你的吩咐去做。”</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008003006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 3:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08003006",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;于是，路得就到麦场去，照她婆婆吩咐的去做。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008003007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 3:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08003007",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;波阿斯吃过晚饭，心里舒畅，便躺在麦堆旁边睡着了。路得悄悄过去掀起盖在他脚上的被，躺在他脚旁。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008003008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 3:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08003008",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;到了半夜，波阿斯忽然惊醒，翻过身来，发现一个女子躺在他的脚旁，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008003009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 3:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08003009",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;便问道：“你是谁？”她答道：“我是你的婢女路得，请用你的衣襟遮盖我，因为你是我的近亲。”</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008003010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 3:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08003010",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;波阿斯说：“姑娘，愿耶和华赐福给你，因为你一直对婆家情深义重，现在更是如此。你本来可以找一个富有或贫穷的年轻丈夫，然而你却没有这样做。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008003011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 3:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08003011",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;姑娘，不要害怕，你所说的一切，我都会去为你安排，城里所有的人都知道你是个贤德的女子。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008003012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 3:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08003012",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;不错，我是你的近亲，可是有一个人比我更近。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008003013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 3:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08003013",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;你今晚就留在这里，明天早上，如果他答应尽亲属的义务，就由他照顾你；如果他不肯，我凭永活的耶和华起誓，我会尽我的本分。现在你只管安心睡到天亮。”</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008003014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 3:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08003014",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;路得就躺在波阿斯的脚旁。天未亮，还看不清人的时候，路得就起来了。因为波阿斯曾对她说：“不可让别人知道有女人来过麦场。”</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008003015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 3:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08003015",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;离开的时候，波阿斯对她说：“把你的外衣拿来铺开。”路得就照做了。他用路得的外衣包了六簸箕大麦，帮她扛在肩上，她便回城了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008003016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 3:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08003016",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;回到家中，婆婆问她：“女儿啊，怎么样了？”路得便将事情的经过都告诉了婆婆。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008003017",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 3:17",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08003017",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>17</sup>&nbsp;她又说：“那个人给了我六簸箕大麦，对我说，‘不要空手回去见你婆婆。’”</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008003018",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 3:18",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08003018",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>18</sup>&nbsp;拿俄米说：“女儿啊！你只管安静等候，看这事怎样发展，因为那人今天不把事情办妥，是绝不会休息的。”</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008004001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 4:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08004001",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;波阿斯来到城门口，坐在那里，恰巧看见他所说的那位至亲经过，便招呼他说：“某人啊，请过来坐一坐。”那人便走过来坐下。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008004002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 4:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08004002",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;波阿斯又邀请了城里的十位长老，对他们说：“请过来坐一坐。”他们都坐下以后，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008004003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 4:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08004003",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;波阿斯便对那位至亲说：“拿俄米从摩押回来了，现在要卖我们族兄以利米勒的那块地，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008004004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 4:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08004004",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;我想应该让你知道这件事。你最有权赎那块地，其次才是我，此外再没有别人了。如果你愿意赎回那块地，请你当着在座各位长老的面表明。如果不愿意，请你让我知道。”那人说：“我愿意赎。”</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008004005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 4:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08004005",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;波阿斯说：“那么，你从拿俄米手中买地的那天，也要娶已死之人的妻子摩押女子路得，好让死者继续在产业上留名。”</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008004006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 4:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08004006",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;那位至亲说：“那我就不能赎了，免得损害到我的产业。你来赎吧，我不能赎。”</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008004007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 4:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08004007",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;从前在以色列，买赎或交易有这样的规矩：一旦成交，一方要把鞋脱下来交给另一方，以色列人以此为成交的凭据。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008004008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 4:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08004008",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;那位至亲对波阿斯说：“你自己买吧！”他就把鞋脱了下来。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008004009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 4:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08004009",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;波阿斯向长老和所有在场的人说：“请各位今天为我作证，所有属于以利米勒、基连和玛伦的产业，我都从拿俄米手上买了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008004010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 4:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08004010",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;同时，我要娶玛伦的遗孀摩押女子路得为妻，好使死者继续在产业上留名，免得他的名在本族本乡中消失。今天，请各位作证。”</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008004011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 4:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08004011",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;聚集在城门口的众人和长老都说：“我们愿意作证。愿耶和华使要进你家门的这女子，像建立以色列家的拉结和利亚一样。愿你在以法他家业兴隆，在伯利恒声名远扬。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008004012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 4:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08004012",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;愿耶和华借着这年轻女子赐你后裔，使你家像先祖犹大和她玛的儿子法勒斯家一样。”</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008004013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 4:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08004013",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;这样，波阿斯便娶了路得为妻，与她同房。耶和华使她怀孕生了一个儿子。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008004014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 4:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08004014",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;妇女们对拿俄米说：“耶和华当受称颂！因为今日祂赐给你一位至亲，使你后继有人，愿这孩子在以色列得享盛名！</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008004015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 4:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08004015",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;他必让你的生命重新得力，奉养你，使你安度晚年，因为他是爱你的儿媳妇所生的。有这儿媳妇比有七个儿子还要好！”</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008004016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 4:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08004016",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;拿俄米接过婴孩抱在怀中，照顾他。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008004017",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 4:17",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08004017",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>17</sup>&nbsp;邻居的妇女们说：“拿俄米有孩子了！”她们给孩子取名叫俄备得，这俄备得就是耶西的父亲，耶西是大卫的父亲。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008004018",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 4:18",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08004018",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>18</sup>&nbsp;以下是法勒斯的家谱：法勒斯生希斯仑，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008004019",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 4:19",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08004019",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>19</sup>&nbsp;希斯仑生兰，兰生亚米拿达，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008004020",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 4:20",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08004020",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>20</sup>&nbsp;亚米拿达生拿顺，拿顺生撒门，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008004021",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 4:21",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08004021",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>21</sup>&nbsp;撒门生波阿斯，波阿斯生俄备得，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10008004022",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "路得记 4:22",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "08004022",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>22</sup>&nbsp;俄备得生耶西，耶西生大卫。</p>"
  }
]